gotten to the thing.

00:08:26.347 --> 00:08:29.800
- No, but the thing that I
am trying now is this thing,

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:33.180
it's called the fasting mimicking diet

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:37.950
that these professors,
or a professor at USC

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:41.370
