00:53:46.311 --> 00:53:49.431
early knowing that they're
not gonna be the low values

00:53:49.431 --> 00:53:53.000
and then they're really
smart on what to wager.

00:53:53.000 --> 00:53:56.730
You can wager everything you've got

00:53:56.730 --> 00:54:00.430
and take risks earlier and really assert,

00:54:00.430 --> 00:54:03.793
acquire a big lead and if
you don't get it right,

00:54:03.793 --> 00:54:08.540
you can recover because you're
still in charge of the game

00:54:08.540 --> 00:54:10.040
and everyone's on their heels.

00:54:11.486 --> 00:54:12.820
And so that's kind of a known--

00:54:12.820 --> 00:54:16.683
- He's changed the game.
