00:55:01.100 --> 00:55:02.780
I think that that's the appeal

00:55:02.780 --> 00:55:04.920
and I think that's most people.

00:55:04.920 --> 00:55:08.010
I think most people when they, again,

00:55:08.010 --> 00:55:10.660
I think most people are
relatively competitive.

00:55:10.660 --> 00:55:11.680
