01:09:11.200 --> 01:09:16.200
but episode 180 called
Living, I wrote it down here,

01:09:16.470 --> 01:09:17.840
I didn't remember exactly.

01:09:17.840 --> 01:09:21.653
Living With a Brain Injury with
Christy Neal who's my wife.

01:09:23.292 --> 01:09:27.670
I don't know that I've ever
actually shared specifically

01:09:27.670 --> 01:09:32.670
that almost three years ago
Christy suffered a brain injury.

01:09:33.279 --> 01:09:37.925
She suffers from post-concussion
syndrome as a result

01:09:37.925 --> 01:09:41.030
of a concussion she had
almost three years ago

01:09:41.030 --> 01:09:45.270
which dramatically changed
her life as well as

01:09:45.270 --> 01:09:48.013
had ramifications for us as a family.

01:09:51.170 --> 01:09:52.870
We've been talking about
when was the right time

01:09:52.870 --> 01:09:55.573
maybe for her to come on Ear
Biscuits and talk about it.

01:09:57.230 --> 01:10:02.230
But she didn't wanna do it
because of the video component,

01:10:02.270 --> 01:10:03.130
honestly.

01:10:03.130 --> 01:10:04.930
She wasn't quite ready for that.

01:10:04.930 --> 01:10:07.963
She doesn't love being on
the videos at this point.

01:10:10.180 --> 01:10:14.279
So Ask Science Mike, check
that out, episode 180.

01:10:14.279 --> 01:10:17.440
Especially if you know
someone who's had a concussion

01:10:17.440 --> 01:10:22.440
or has suffered from an invisible injury

01:10:22.480 --> 01:10:27.346
that impacts your life, I
think there's lots of takeaways

01:10:27.346 --> 01:10:32.280
and I'm super proud of her
for everything she shared.

01:10:32.280 --> 01:10:35.720
I think it's tremendously,
it can be really powerful

01:10:35.720 --> 01:10:37.380
to someone who's going through it

01:10:37.380 --> 01:10:40.323
or knows someone who is so check that out.

01:10:43.420 --> 01:10:45.570
And I think that's all I have
to say about it at this time.

01:10:45.570 --> 01:10:49.160
I do think that at some point,
maybe she'll come on the air,

01:10:49.160 --> 01:10:50.640
